        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n    ANANSE[\&quot;ANANSE TELECOM\&quot;]\n    WALLET[\&quot;ANANSE WALLET\&quot;]\n    TRANSACTION[\&quot;ANANSE TRANSACTION\&quot;]\n\n    CUSTOMER[\&quot;CUSTOMER\&quot;]\n\n    SIKA[\&quot;SIKACREDIT\&quot;]\n    SIKA_ACTIVITY[\&quot;LOAN / REPAYMENT\&quot;]\n\n    OMAN[\&quot;OMAN REMIT\&quot;]\n    REMIT[\&quot;REMITTANCE\&quot;]\n\n    FINANCIAL_CONSEQUENCE[\&quot;FINANCIAL CONSEQUENCE\&quot;]\n\n    ANANSE --&gt;|\&quot;owns and operates\&quot;| WALLET\n\n    CUSTOMER --&gt;|\&quot;participates in\&quot;| TRANSACTION\n    WALLET --&gt;|\&quot;used in\&quot;| TRANSACTION\n\n    SIKA --&gt; SIKA_ACTIVITY\n    OMAN --&gt; REMIT\n\n    SIKA_ACTIVITY --&gt;|\&quot;may produce\&quot;| FINANCIAL_CONSEQUENCE\n    REMIT --&gt;|\&quot;may produce\&quot;| FINANCIAL_CONSEQUENCE\n\n    FINANCIAL_CONSEQUENCE --&gt;|\&quot;may affect\&quot;| WALLET\n\n    NOTE[\&quot;WALLET RELATIONSHIP PRINCIPLE&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The wallet is a distinct financial object owned and operated by Ananse Telecom.&lt;br/&gt;Ananse transactions directly involve the wallet.&lt;br/&gt;SikaCredit and Oman Remit activities may produce financial consequences affecting the wallet.&lt;br/&gt;These cross-institutional relationships are conceptual and are not represented as direct&lt;br/&gt;SikaCredit → Wallet or Oman Remit → Wallet relational links.\&quot;]&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="7s2v3GDVgfhfRH16O8kl-10">
